# AWS Catalog API Credentials
# ============================
# These credentials expire regularly (every few days to weeks)
# 
# To get fresh credentials:
# 1. Open in your browser:
#    https://registration.awsevents.com/flow/awsevents/reinvent2026/event-catalog/page/eventCatalog
# 2. Log in and wait for the catalog to load
# 3. Open DevTools (F12)
# 4. Go to Network tab and look for POST request to "catalog.awsevents.com/api/sessions"
# 5. In the Request > Form data, copy the values for:
#    - apiProfile → API_PROFILE_ID
#    - rfWidgetId → RF_WIDGET_ID
#
# Then run: npm run fetch

